# Keep the build context to the dependency manifests only (KB-sized).
#
# The test image deliberately never receives project sources: it is reused
# across commits and only refreshed when a lock file changes. Everything is
# excluded first, then the manifests the Dockerfile COPYs are re-included.
#
# Explicit exclusions. Redundant under `**` for now, but they document the
# contract and keep holding if the whitelist below is ever relaxed:
.git
target
webui/node_modules
webui/dist
docker-out
.ansible
openspec/changes/archive
# Whitelist: only the manifests the Dockerfile COPYs. Everything else stays
# out of the build context.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile.test
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!xtask/
!xtask/Cargo.toml
!appkeeper-bench/
!appkeeper-bench/Cargo.toml
!webui/
!webui/package.json
!webui/pnpm-lock.yaml
